# Local state and workspace files for both roots (gcp/, aws/). Never commit:
# state holds database passwords in plain text.
**/.terraform/
**/.terraform.lock.hcl
**/terraform.tfstate
**/terraform.tfstate.*
**/crash.log
**/crash.*.log

# Real variable values and the make-managed layer toggles.
**/*.tfvars
!**/*.tfvars.example
